# No scrcpy branding

Never mention "scrcpy" (or "Scrcpy") in any user-facing text: UI labels, status messages, tooltips, errors shown to users, dialogs, or in-app help.

Say "mirror window", "native mirror", or "mirroring" instead.

Internal code (binary paths, env vars, comments, vendor scripts) may still refer to scrcpy.
